{"resourceIdentifier":"994","resourceName":"TIST Program in India, VCS-001","description":"Since its inception in 1999, over 63,000 participants organized into over 8,900 TIST Small Groups have planted over ten million trees in Tanzania, India, Kenya, Uganda, Nicaragua, and Honduras - accomplishing GhG sequestration through tree planting, creating a potential long-term income stream, and developing sustainable environments and livelihoods. Currently over 50,000 TIST participants in over 6,900 Small Groups are registered in the TIST program in Kenya and are working to break their local cycle of deforestation, drought and famine.  The trees planted in tens of thousands of discrete groves and land parcels are already beginning to reduce erosion, stabilize and enrich the soil, and will soon be providing shade.    VCS 001:  This is a VCS grouped project, is a subset of the TIST reforestation project in India and applies to 452 Small Groups, 2,599 members, 924 project areas and 671.8 ha.  TIST Progam in India VCS 001 is the same project as TIST Program in India CCB 001.,","location":{"latitude":12.510175,"longitude":79.667850},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-01-10","endExclusive":"2024-02-10","endInclusive":"2024-02-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"994"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tamil Nadu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Clean Air Action Corporation"},{"type":"string","value":"ME, United States"},{"type":"string","value":"918-747-8770"},{"type":"string","value":"https://program.tist.org/"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"994"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"994"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"11